# Keep LF in the working tree on every platform, so it matches .prettierrc's
# `endOfLine: "lf"`. Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks files out
# as CRLF and `npm run format:check` fails on a freshly cloned repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch line endings
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
